(SA, 170, "For an A.P., if T_{3} = 18 and T_{7} = 30, then S_{17} is equal to", ["612", "622", "306", "None of these"], "A", ["T_{7} − T_{3} = 4d = 12, so d = 3, and a = 18 − 2 × 3 = 12.", "S_{17} = 17/2 × [2 × 12 + 16 × 3] = 17/2 × 72 = 612."]),
