(SA, 174, "The average of 7 consecutive numbers is 20. The largest of these numbers is", ["20", "22", "23", "24"], "C", ["For consecutive numbers the average is the middle (4th) number, 20.", "The numbers are 17 to 23, so the largest is 23."]),
